---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="FMLA Case Tracker - HR Tools">
  <div class="container max-w-[1800px] mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <div id="fmla-tracker-root" class="bg-[var(--card-bg)] border border-[var(--border-color)] rounded-lg shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
      <iframe
        src="/FMLATracker/index.html"
        class="w-full border-0"
        style="min-height: 900px;"
        title="FMLA Case Tracker Tool"
      ></iframe>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/20 border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-800 rounded-lg p-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 mb-3">How to Use</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200">
        <li>Work the compliance queue first: it lists every open statutory deadline, soonest first</li>
        <li>The colored rail on each case tracks the eligibility notice, certification, cure, and designation clocks</li>
        <li>Entitlement uses a rolling 12-month lookback, summed across all cases for the same UIN</li>
        <li>Enter hours from the FMLA Calculator into the case hours ledger</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-6 bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-900/20 border border-amber-200 dark:border-amber-800 rounded-lg p-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-100 mb-3">Confidentiality</h2>
      <p class="text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-200">
        FMLA records are confidential medical records under 29 CFR 825.500(g) and must be
        kept separate from personnel files. Record dates, hours, and status only. Do not
        enter diagnoses, symptoms, or treatment details. Store certification forms in the
        sanctioned document system and reference them by ID.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
